        "l": 62.2297,
        "t": 127.08050000000003,
        "r": 296.2568999999998,
        "b": 114.90350000000001
      },
      "content": "The air cooler is provided with a moisture trap (MT).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_178",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
